wuu code-mode host
==================

The crates under `crates/protocol`, `crates/runtime`, and `crates/host` are
derived from the following components of the OpenAI Codex CLI repository
(https://github.com/openai/codex), commit `6750f5bd1356fe1553c0fcc9f2632704f3055946`,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- `codex-rs/code-mode-protocol` (crate `codex-code-mode-protocol`)
- `codex-rs/code-mode-runtime` (crate `codex-code-mode-runtime`)
- `codex-rs/code-mode-host` (crate `codex-code-mode-host`)

Portions of `crates/shim/src/lib.rs` are derived from `codex-rs/protocol`
(`tool_name.rs`, `local_media.rs`) of the same repository.

Modifications made for Wuu:

- Removed the gRPC transport, protobuf definitions, and OpenTelemetry export.
- Replaced the `codex-protocol` dependency with the small local `wuu-codemode-shim`
  crate containing `ToolName` and `MAX_PROMPT_AUDIO_INPUT_BYTES`.
- Renamed the binary to `wuu-code-mode-host`.

The full Apache 2.0 license text is in `LICENSE-APACHE`.
